@startuml
!include style.iuml
title 普通数据面与 AI 隧道凭据边界
left to right direction
file "普通数据面服务端凭据\napp/xray/.env" as normal
actor "代理客户端" as client
file "AI 节点权威配置\n独立 REALITY 凭据" as authority
component "AI inbound\n私钥与客户端认证" as inbound
component "普通数据面 ai_proxy outbound\n公钥与隧道参数" as outbound
normal --> client : 普通数据面连接参数
authority --> inbound : AI inbound 身份与私钥
authority --> outbound : 仅同步匹配的公钥与隧道参数
outbound --> inbound : VLESS + REALITY
note bottom of authority
REALITY 私钥只留在 AI 节点权威配置中。
主数据面只保存对应公钥和匹配字段，
不得复用普通数据面 inbound 凭据。
end note

@enduml
